ion pipeline So will you be able to tell if it is reference free or reference based Simply you have to ask if the correct answer is given in your golden data set or not If it is not given, it is a reference free one If it is given, it is a reference based one Simple, this is the difference That is why I had to teach you this That is why I gave you the three examples that I gave you earlier I deliberately took an example in the human one That\", \"evals we discussed that model evals also have two types of evals one is standardized evals which we call benchmarks which we studied knowledge capability where we discussed multiple benchmarks that comes under this topic and then we also discussed that according to your application when you have to choose a model you can run custom model evals which you make your own dataset and run so we covered this in the previous lecture so in short we have covered so much in this playlist and now the most important part of this playlist is which is this application evals and we will start from today from today we will learn that if you have an LLMEval based application then how can you evaluate it based on all the knowledge that we have gathered till now and here also you have to understand that\", \"evaluation is an evaluation where you have a reference unknown correct answer or the key thing a correct answer must contain written down in advance for each test case you grade by comparing the output against the reference tell me quickly the last three examples we have seen programmatic where we evaluated retriever human where we evaluated chatbot's helpfulness and llm as a judge where we made upsc can you tell me which of these evaluations are reference based which means we already knew the correct answer which methods we covered reference based where we knew the answer answer we know in golden dataset tell me quickly the one we discussed the one we discussed the one we discussed the one we discussed the one we discussed the one we disc