ction-grade software.\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"statement\": \"Air Canada's chatbot incident resulted in a significant loss due to incorrect deployment.\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"The statement discusses a real-world incident involving Air Canada's chatbot, indicating that veeb testing can lead to issues if not properly implemented.\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"statement\": \"Teams often deploy LLM-based applications without proper validation through veeb testing.\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"This statement highlights a common practice among developers who overlook veeb testing, leading to potential failures.\"\n            }\n        ]\n    },\n    {\n        \"verdicts\": [\n            {\n                \"statement\": \"Vibe testing is necessary for deploying an LLM app\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"statement\": \"Vibe testing helps ensure the software behaves correctly in production\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"statement\": \"Vibe testing provides insights into potential issues before deployment\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"statement\": \"Vibe testing allows for proper testing of the application before release\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"statement\": \"Vibe testing ensures safety by identifying risks associated with direct deployment\",\n                \"verdict\": \"yes\",\n                \"reason\": \"\"\n            },\n            {\n                \"statement\": \